module Core

### Represents the protocol for unchecked exponentiation.
### `UncheckedExponentiable` is for types whose power operation deliberately
### skips the overflow check. Implementations typically lower to a loop of
### unchecked multiplications, so any overflow is undefined behavior.
protocol UncheckedExponentiable
  ### Returns the unchecked power of this value raised by `you`.
  ### Overflow at any intermediate step is undefined behavior.
  ### :param you: The exponent value.
  ### :returns: The resulting `Me` value.
  @readonly
  dangerous routine Me.$pow_unchecked(you: Me) -> ?Me
